  "body": "This reverts commit 651ea9976f8506b216851d9f52e11803fbe988e8.\n\nThere's already a fallback to the missing value default in\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/infrastructure.html#keywords-and-enumerated-attributes\n\n\"If the attribute value matches none of the given keywords, but the\nattribute has an invalid value default, then the attribute represents\nthat state. Otherwise, if the attribute value matches none of the\nkeywords but there is a missing value default state defined, then that\nis the state represented by the attribute.\"\n\nSee https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/51\n",
